{"language":"kr","values":[["/names/cn","太一与亚古兽"],["/names/kr","신태일&아구몬"],["/description_i18n/cn","太一是拥有优秀的领导力和行动力的小学五年级学生，持有勇气徽章。亚古兽是他的搭档数码宝贝，总是充满活力。"],["/description_i18n/kr","뛰어난 리더십과 행동력을 지닌 초등학교 5학년 학생인 신태일은 용기의 문장을 가지고 있으며, 아구몬은 신태일의 파트너 디지몬으로 언제나 활력이 넘친다."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","行くぞアグモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/jp","行くぞ、アグモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/kr","行くぞ、アグモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/kr","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"行くぞ、アグモン！","text":"上吧，亚古兽！","target_transcript":"行くぞアグモン！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/kr",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"行くぞ、アグモン！","text":"가자, 아구몬!","target_transcript":"行くぞ、アグモン！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/jp","アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/kr","アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/kr","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。","text":"亚古兽变得更强了。","target_transcript":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/kr",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。","text":"아구몬이 더 강해졌어.","target_transcript":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human